    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《Huah-lin-long　賣雜細　來講古》</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳彥汝&nbsp;</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhmZQITxCZb2rwZovkBA5kQu-8c6OR50Wcb8qSR1AU4ySqyj455BSRwdc97p6DlQ9Pt-KsyBLj-kS_8Arnn8yRcsIltDS9cTn0t7Es6J85nNnPhZgDpef3doOzv8KyVf9QFjPJR-MF4BtUJwwYAVcpNqU2-D8TST_6Zllw7VAQHQH7xW4q6NbSsDIuWki37\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhmZQITxCZb2rwZovkBA5kQu-8c6OR50Wcb8qSR1AU4ySqyj455BSRwdc97p6DlQ9Pt-KsyBLj-kS_8Arnn8yRcsIltDS9cTn0t7Es6J85nNnPhZgDpef3doOzv8KyVf9QFjPJR-MF4BtUJwwYAVcpNqU2-D8TST_6Zllw7VAQHQH7xW4q6NbSsDIuWki37=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi3AT7AruKomrmKyDCjA_AwSfOtYVXEFltEWi8CYVwVvVYTP-2xzOaGLKdcYPljixhosZYCzUc6C_CcRIhxbbOGPvIXUCSmz8krzccgBAr-26sKkr1AsZqaY1r0VS30pXEGVPqVXCS_D6umkVX9fuqBccMMyTNVGhFtW7BWujqoirybMwcjDqNQ3TsziRya\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi3AT7AruKomrmKyDCjA_AwSfOtYVXEFltEWi8CYVwVvVYTP-2xzOaGLKdcYPljixhosZYCzUc6C_CcRIhxbbOGPvIXUCSmz8krzccgBAr-26sKkr1AsZqaY1r0VS30pXEGVPqVXCS_D6umkVX9fuqBccMMyTNVGhFtW7BWujqoirybMwcjDqNQ3TsziRya=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">月娘無聲無sueh行到倚西爿ê天頂，大路四箍圍仔沓沓仔恬靜--落-來--ah，kan-na聽著翰林橋頂si-si-su̍t-su̍t ê聲音——有幾隻獅仔leh伸勻、有ê leh扒癢，上hàng奶ê hit隻獅仔uì橋頂跳--落-來，大聲huah：「萬善爺公，出來kah阮tshit-thô講古，萬善爺公……」原本徛tī伊後壁ê 12个兄弟，mā做伙行tuì萬善廟前ê榕仔跤。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">廟內行出來幾若个形影，月光tshiō著一个金毛--ê，一个戴瓜le̍h仔ê作穡人，koh有兩个面模仔khah深ê原住民，上落尾是一个老歲仔人。金毛ê oo-jí-sáng先開喙：「有lín tsit陣愛纏tuè ê獅仔，阮tsia-ê萬善爺，逐工mā無閒kah ná干樂--leh。」Tsit陣獅仔，有ê是客人獅——就是獅頭ná盒仔ê形，有ê是m̄開喙ê Ho̍h-ló獅，koh有一寡看--起-來是廟埕前ê獅仔形，tsit 13隻獅仔，hit當時是翰林橋leh起做ê時，想beh hōo逐家知影新竹縣有13个鄉鎮，用銅做--出-來--ê。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">看--起-來上有歲ê老大人手ǹg前ia̍t--leh：「Lin-long--a，來tsia、來tsia。」手攑lin-long鼓ê獅仔，喙phué金滑仔金滑，應講：「萬善爺公，頂擺你教--阮ê囡仔歌，逐家lóng ē-hiáu唸--ah。」Lin-long--a先tshuā頭：「琉璃燈，ngiâ去媽祖間，媽祖婆無閒，ngiâ去觀音亭，觀音媽面笑笑，ngiâ去大眾廟……」其他ê獅仔兄弟做伙tuè唸：「大眾爺面烏烏，ngiâ去絞場埔，絞場埔無發草，ngiâ去西門口，西門口無石頭，ngiâ去北鼓樓，北鼓樓無米倉，ngiâ去田中ng。」看in ná唸ná搖尾，激kah萬善爺逐家笑hai-hai。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Iáu是lín唸ê古早調khah好聽。」金毛ê oo-jí-sáng拍pho̍k仔講：「今仔日是西洋鬼仔節，大路頂一陣一陣ê細漢囡仔huah講：「Hōo我食甜甜，無就kā你ko-ko纏，hām我tsit个荷蘭人mā嫌siunn吵。」「荷蘭，是m̄是tsiânn遠ê所在？頂擺我問講，是按怎lín ē同齊蹛tī tsit間萬善爺廟，lín看--起-來tsiok無sio仝——無仝ê歲數、無仝ê職業、無仝ê面容，甚至有Ho̍h-ló人、客人、原住民koh有阿啄仔。」跤踏一粒球ê阿球獅ná sńg球ná問。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">頭戴瓜le̍h仔ê萬善爺指ǹg上有歲ê hit个：「賣雜細--ê，你上gâu講古，你kā lán hōo人囥鬥陣ê由來講清楚」，老大人tìm頭應講：「十人來台，六亡，三在，一回頭。Uì唐山渡海來台灣tsit个所在，ē-sái平安到位就是無簡單、拚性命；beh tī tsia生活，m̄-nā ē拄著風颱、瘟疫，為著爭地盤，各族群不時sio拍sio刣。」伊ná摸喙鬚ná回想：「像我只是一个賣雜細ê普通人，想講來tsia趁錢hōo故鄉ê母囝khah好過日，siáng知影tio̍h-tse枉死tī路邊，佳哉有好心人kā我打扎，tsiah有thang hōo人服sāi，享受香火」。見講講過去，實在是過去講bē了，萬善爺信仰tī台灣tsiânn sù常，伊m̄-nā hōo真濟人ê精神有寄託，mā見證íng過開墾台灣ê艱苦。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lin-long--a看著逐家心肝稀微，面色歹看，趕緊搖伊手底ê lin-long鼓：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Lin-lin-long　lin-lin-long-long</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>huah-lin-long　賣雜細</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>街頭巷尾sì-kè se̍h</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>今日uì tsia過</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>看你愛啥貨</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>lóng m̄免講價</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>絕對無問題！</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit隻獅仔出力搖kha-tshng花，弄kah大大細細大力拍pho̍k仔做伙講：「無論是胭脂水粉膨粉kah膨紗，阮就是huah-lin-long、賣雜細」。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">天bâ霧仔光，車路頂開始有車leh起行，一直無開喙ê原住民萬善爺公，沓沓仔行往翰林橋頂，「來！來！來！Lín tsit陣守護獅開始做khang-khuè。」13隻銅獅，各人徛tńg去各人ê位，自網路頂有人傳說摸獅仔考試ē考kuân分、tio̍h頭名，mā有人傳講摸lin-long--a ê喙phué，ē-sái有好運，過路ê人sù常ē kah in tsit陣獅仔sio借問。廟門開--ah，萬善爺公庇佑竹北ê一工起鼓--ah，橋頂kah廟內lóng有sio仝ê ǹg望，誠心ǹg望逐家lóng ē-sái實現願望。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div></span><span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div></span><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.